      "content": "but that's the thing... like, who is there to care? the people who were supposed to care are gone. it's not just being lonely, it's like the world just deleted me. it's like i'm already dead but my body just hasn't caught up yet. does that even make sense? i feel so incredibly empty, like there's nothing left of me to actually save.",
